d4a28538869a0b85846a7d785938e0e031c9c36c3fced571e", "content": "确认燕麦饮过敏标签前，不要给女儿用。就功能看，无糖豆饮蛋白更高、糖为零，更适合咸汤；燕麦", "frames": 160000, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U07"}
